    trash-bin.glb - 0.40 \xD7 0.80 \xD7 0.40 m, 25 kg, culled past 80 m\n  Prop_Bench:
    rebound 6 texture slot(s) onto compressed copies across 2 material(s)\n  props:
    Bench prefab from bench.glb - 1.30 \xD7 0.45 \xD7 0.56 m, 60 kg, culled past
    100 m\n  props: 66/70 lit intersections got a bin\n  props: Place_GasStation
    - 4/4 cones on the kerb\n  props: Place_AutoShop - 4/4 cones on the kerb\n  props:
    boulevard 'west' - 13/13 benches every 20 m (0 skipped at storefronts)\n  props:
    boulevard 'east' - 11/13 benches every 20 m (2 skipped at storefronts)\n  navigation:
    kept the previous bake (2 group(s) re-attached) - run Build World + NavMesh to
    redo it"
